* `\Nhanes\questionnaire\alcohol use\drink 5 in a day\` – categorical yes/no for drinking five or more drinks in a day.
* `\Nhanes\questionnaire\alcohol use\drink per day\` – continuous number of drinks per day.
* `\Nhanes\questionnaire\alcohol use\days 5 drinks in year\` – continuous count of days with five‑drink episodes per year.

There is also one categorical code from the Synthea synthetic dataset for alcohol‑related disorders (`F10 Alcohol related disorders`).
